{"id":1841,"date":"2024-11-22T12:13:36","date_gmt":"2024-11-22T12:13:36","guid":{"rendered":"/dubai-security-licence/"},"modified":"2024-11-25T08:11:25","modified_gmt":"2024-11-25T08:11:25","slug":"dubai-security-licence","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"/dubai-security-licence/","title":{"rendered":"A Complete Guide to Obtaining a Dubai Security Licence"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\n\t\t\t<p>Installing a security system is easy, the complex part is to apply for a Dubai security licence. The CCTV installed at your home or workplace is not just a camera on the wall. But, it acts as an eye protecting your valuable property in your absence.</p>\n<p>The installer you choose must have the right knowledge and tools. This is necessary for effective security. If you fail to do so, you might face hacking and misuse of these cameras.</p>\n<p>DubaiÃ¢â‚¬â„¢s regulatory authority has set strict standards to ensure your CCTV system can be trusted. These are known as the Security Industry Regulatory Agency (SIRA)</p>\n<p>This guide is penned down to discuss:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>What is the Security Industry Regulatory Authority (SIRA)?</li>\n<li>How to apply for an SIRA Licence?</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sira-training\">Steps to get SIRA certification</a></li>\n<li>How Emirati Guard help you in obtaining a SIRA licence</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>What is SIRA?</h2>\n<p>The Security Industry Regulatory Authority commonly known as <strong>SIRA</strong>. It is now called the <strong>FINRA</strong>, Financial Industry Regulatory Agency. ItÃ¢â‚¬â„¢s a combination of regulatory units, the (<strong>NASD</strong>) National Association of Securities Dealers and the (<strong>NYSE</strong>) New York Stock Exchange.</p>\n<p>The function of SIRA is to look at securities, brokers, and their dealings with the investing public. The purpose surrounds that members and affiliated markets follow best practices.</p>\n<p>SIRA certification is crucial for CCTV installations in Dubai. Having a valid certification means that the CCTV installed meets guidelines and uses the latest technology. In short, Dubai mandates SIRA-certified CCTVs for proper security surveillance today. This is particularly true in building areas. The important thing here is only a few businesses have implemented it.</p>\n<h2>How to Apply for a SIRA Licence</h2>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1844 size-full\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/How-to-Apply-for-a-SIRA-Licence.webp\" alt=\"How to Apply for a SIRA Licence\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/How-to-Apply-for-a-SIRA-Licence.webp 1920w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/11/How-to-Apply-for-a-SIRA-Licence-300x169.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/11/How-to-Apply-for-a-SIRA-Licence-1024x576.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/11/How-to-Apply-for-a-SIRA-Licence-768x432.webp 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/11/How-to-Apply-for-a-SIRA-Licence-1536x864.webp 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/11/How-to-Apply-for-a-SIRA-Licence-320x180.webp 320w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/11/How-to-Apply-for-a-SIRA-Licence-480x270.webp 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/11/How-to-Apply-for-a-SIRA-Licence-800x450.webp 800w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/11/How-to-Apply-for-a-SIRA-Licence-1200x675.webp 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\"></p>\n<p>If your organization looking for an SIRA Licence, they need to follow the below guide. We specified two different ways to apply for SIRA in Dubai:</p>\n<p><strong><em>Ã¢â‚¬â€&gt; HereÃ¢â‚¬â„¢s the first way</em></strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Employer-Sponsored Training:</strong> If hired by a security company, YouÃ¢â‚¬â„¢ll be enrolled at the Security Cadre Training Centre (SCTC) to get the licence.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong><em>Ã¢â‚¬â€&gt; HereÃ¢â‚¬â„¢s the second way</em></strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Self-Enrolled Training:</strong> In another scenario, you can attend the SCTC on your own. Enroll in the training or course. After completion, obtain the licence.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>The SIRA courses and training in the UAE are accessible. They are available even on a tourist visa. It is advisable to complete a course. Completing the course adds a valuable certification to your profile. It qualifies you for roles like:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Security guard</li>\n<li>CCTV operator, or</li>\n<li>Dubai Security licence security system engineerÃ¢â‚¬â€all of which require SIRA certification.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Steps to get SIRA Certification</h2>\n<p>Upon course completion, youÃ¢â‚¬â„¢re ready to embark on getting your SIRA licence. We have explained how you can obtain a SIRA licence by following three simple steps:</p>\n<p><strong>Step 1Ã¢â‚¬â€&gt; Visit the SCTC Website</strong><br>\nVisit the SIRA official website. Here, scroll down and select the course you want to get certified.</p>\n<p><strong>Step 2Ã¢â‚¬â€&gt; Download the Application Form</strong><br>\nNext, download and complete the application form. After filling out the form, send it through the email to email protected. SIRA will review your application. Stay focused, SIRA will reply with the next steps.</p>\n<p><strong>Step 3Ã¢â‚¬â€&gt;</strong> <strong>Visit the SIRA Cadre Academy</strong><br>\nUpon receiving a confirmation email, go to the SIRA Cadre Training Center. Gather the below document and take them with you:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Application Form</li>\n<li>2 passport-sized color photos</li>\n<li>2 passport copies, or</li>\n<li>Emirates ID copies (Front &amp; Back) in color</li>\n</ul>\n<p>An Emirates ID is not required if you are on a tourist visa, At the SCTC office, you need to pay the SIRA training course fee using any of these options. You can pay the fees through:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Bank deposit receipt</li>\n<li>Current dated cheque</li>\n<li>Debit or credit card</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Additional Training for Security Guards</h2>\n<p>Security guard candidates must complete additional training from Dubai government departments. This is necessary <strong>t</strong>o meet safety requirements. The sessions include training on handling Ã¢â‚¬Å“People of Determination.Ã¢â‚¬Â This training is available at the Dubai Academy. It costs you AED 50. You can apply and pay at the DPA office.</p>\n<p>Additionally, candidates applying for a SIRA licence in Dubai without company sponsorship should register and book a training date beforehand. This step may seem lengthy and in actuality it is lengthy. However, each step is handled with great care.</p>\n<p>If you find it hard to do it yourself, you can hire someone experienced. There are several SIRA-approved CCTV companies in Dubai operating. Make an informed decision by checking on their market reputation and client feedback. Pick someone who serves clients from small businesses to large corporations. Choose a SIRA-certified provider who focuses on understanding client needs. The best service provider recommends the best solutions, implements efficient systems, and provides ongoing support.</p>\n<h2>Hire Emirati Guard to Obtain Your SIRA Licence Today</h2>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1845 size-full\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Obtain-Your-SIRA-Licence.webp\" alt=\"Obtain Your SIRA Licence\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Obtain-Your-SIRA-Licence.webp 1920w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Obtain-Your-SIRA-Licence-300x169.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Obtain-Your-SIRA-Licence-1024x576.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Obtain-Your-SIRA-Licence-768x432.webp 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Obtain-Your-SIRA-Licence-1536x864.webp 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Obtain-Your-SIRA-Licence-320x180.webp 320w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Obtain-Your-SIRA-Licence-480x270.webp 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Obtain-Your-SIRA-Licence-800x450.webp 800w, /wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Obtain-Your-SIRA-Licence-1200x675.webp 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/\"><strong>