g body that oversees is SIRA (Security Industry Regulatory Authority). They are responsible for determining if private security firms and employees are abiding by Dubai law. Additionally, the SIRA training centers in the UAE provide basic security guard instruction. These trainings are for people who want to work as security guards there.</p>\n\n\t\t</div>","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>[&hellip;]</p>","protected":false},"author":26,"featured_media":10001841,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":[],"categories":[34,6],"tags":[246,247],"class_list":["post","post-1841","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry"]}